            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.18.2</h2>
<p>One fix to the Focus screen.</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>The empty task list reads cleanly again.</b> On a day with meetings
      and no tasks, the "Your day is clear" line was drawn on top of the
      TASKS heading. It now sits under the heading, where the first task
      would be.</li>
</ul>
